itch\n• bowline\n\n• allowing for boom deflection\n• boom/jib as low as possible\n• crane stability\n• gently accelerating and braking on slew/boom to minimise load swing\n• lowering load safely onto appropriate dunnage taking into consideration swing and restrictions of area\n• minimum boom/jib length\n• minimum speed\n• using handheld tag lines as required\n• identification of incorrect sling of load\n\n• jib\n• fly jib (where fitted)\n\n• lightning\n• wind\n• water impacted ground\n• ultraviolet (UV) exposure\n\n• backfilled ground\n• bitumen\n• concrete\n• hard compacted soil\n• pre-contaminated soils\n• rock\n• rough, uneven ground\n• soft soils","supersededBy":null,"supersedes":{"code":"TLILIC0002","url":"https://training.gov.au/training/details/TLILIC0002"},"sections":[{"heading":"Issue with Power BI reports","level":2,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Unit of competency","level":3,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Modification history","level":2,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Application","level":2,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Pre-requisite unit","level":2,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Competency field","level":2,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Unit sector","level":2,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Elements and performance criteria","level":2,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Foundation skills","level":2,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Range of conditions","level":2,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Assessment requirements","level":3,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Modification history","level":2,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Performance evidence","level":2,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Knowledge evidence","level":2,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Assessment conditions","level":2,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Qualifications that include this unit","level":2,"paragraphs":[],"lists":[]},{"heading":"Skill sets that include this unit","leve